      "id": "sol.ahsme-1950-p20.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "By the Remainder Theorem, the remainder upon division by \\(x-1\\) is the value of the polynomial at \\(x=1.\\) This value is \\[ 1^{13}+1=2. \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
